messages:
rachel: Quick request from client: one-page presales cheat for integrating the SDK with streaming + function/tool calls + structured JSON output. Hosted POC only. Need handshake curl, minimal node snippet, and a tiny cost hint for ~40 rps @ ~1k tokens.
sam: Short answer: ephemeral creds -> SDK credentialProvider -> open stream w/ subprotocol `rwd-stream-v1` -> send meta with schema_id -> handle `toolcall` -> reply `tool_response`. Keep it copy/paste.
diego: Streaming knobs: suggest `max_inflight=6`, `heartbeat=20s`, jittered backoff on 429s. If they expect bursts use short batch REST endpoints instead.
sam: Minimal curl (presales):
```
curl -X POST https://presales.redwood.ai/v1/ephemeral \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer PRESALES_KEY" \
  -d '{"account":"client-x","purpose":"poc"}'
# returns {"token":"ey...","expires_in":900}
```
rachel: Node snippet to paste? Keep tiny.
diego: Pasteable Node snippet:
```js
const client = new RedwoodClient({ credentialProvider: async () => ({ token: await getEphemeral() }), streaming: true });
const stream = await client.stream({ model: 'rwd-4-small' });
stream.send({ type: 'meta', schema_id: 'clientx-v1', strict: true });
stream.on('message', async (m) => {
  if (m.type === 'toolcall') {
    const out = await callExternal(m.args);
    stream.send({ type: 'tool_response', id: m.id, result: out });
  }
});
```
qa-bot: Note: enable schema validation to surface regressions (`schema_violation` events). Add a small eval set.
sam: Cost hint: 40 rps @ ~1k tokens -> large if 24/7 (billions/day). For a business-hours POC the daily tokens are much smaller; recommend a 1-2 hour representative run to size accurately. We'll DM a conservative ballpark.
rachel: Perfect. I'll send this as a one-pager with the demo link. Thanks! :thumbsup:
